{
  "pid": "public-easy-04",
  "source": "public",
  "difficulty": "easy",
  "title": "Jam Pump Debouncing and Runtime Maintenance",
  "requirements": "Implement jam-pump interlocking, time-based debouncing, accumulated runtime and the 500-hour maintenance indication. This portable benchmark represents durations as integer milliseconds: DebounceMs and CycleMs are positive DINTs in 1..3600000. PUMP_RUNTIME_ACC is a LINT in milliseconds. Only the numeric-millisecond interface is graded.\nAt startup the outputs and elapsed counters are zero. On each invocation count the full CycleMs since the previous invocation. If PASTE_E_STOP_NC and VISCOSITY_OK are both TRUE, add that interval to the current uninterrupted valid duration. Run in this scan iff this duration has reached the current DebounceMs. Either input being FALSE immediately stops the pump and discards the debounce duration; the next valid period starts at zero. CycleMs may vary between scans.\nWhen VFD_RUN is TRUE add this scan's full CycleMs to PUMP_RUNTIME_ACC, including the qualifying scan. Otherwise preserve PUMP_RUNTIME_ACC. When and only when the accumulated value is at least 1800000000 milliseconds (500 h), PUMP_MAINT_DUE is TRUE. The indicator never inhibits operation. Executions exceeding the LINT range are outside this benchmark.",
  "variables": [
    {
      "name": "VISCOSITY_OK",
      "data_type": "BOOL",
      "description": "Raw signal indicating that viscosity is within the permitted range.",
      "direction": "input",
      "fields": []
    },
    {
      "name": "PASTE_E_STOP_NC",
      "data_type": "BOOL",
      "description": "Normally closed emergency-stop circuit; TRUE permits operation and FALSE means emergency stop.",
      "direction": "input",
      "fields": []
    },
    {
      "name": "DebounceMs",
      "data_type": "DINT",
      "description": "Minimum uninterrupted valid duration (integer milliseconds, 1..3600000).",
      "direction": "input",
      "fields": []
    },
    {
      "name": "CycleMs",
      "data_type": "DINT",
      "description": "Duration represented by this scan in integer milliseconds (1..3600000).",
      "direction": "input",
      "fields": []
    },
    {
      "name": "VFD_RUN",
      "data_type": "BOOL",
      "description": "Pump variable-frequency-drive run command.",
      "direction": "output",
      "fields": []
    },
    {
      "name": "PUMP_MAINT_DUE",
      "data_type": "BOOL",
      "description": "Maintenance indication when accumulated runtime reaches 500 hours.",
      "direction": "output",
      "fields": []
    },
    {
      "name": "PUMP_RUNTIME_ACC",
      "data_type": "LINT",
      "description": "Accumulated run duration in integer milliseconds (LINT).",
      "direction": "output",
      "fields": []
    }
  ],
  "target_pou": "FUNCTION_BLOCK",
  "specs": [
    {
      "sid": "S1",
      "text": "当急停回路断开（PASTE_E_STOP_NC=FALSE）时，VFD_RUN 必须为 FALSE。",
      "ltl": "G(NOT PASTE_E_STOP_NC -> NOT VFD_RUN)",
      "kind": "safety",
      "verified_by": "bounded_checker"
    },
    {
      "sid": "S2",
      "text": "当粘度原始信号为 FALSE 时，去抖条件立即失效，VFD_RUN 必须为 FALSE。",
      "ltl": "G(NOT VISCOSITY_OK -> NOT VFD_RUN)",
      "kind": "safety",
      "verified_by": "bounded_checker"
    },
    {
      "sid": "S3",
      "text": "累计时间达到或超过 1,800,000,000 毫秒时且仅在此时给出维护提示。",
      "ltl": "G((PUMP_RUNTIME_ACC >= 1800000000 -> PUMP_MAINT_DUE) AND (PUMP_MAINT_DUE -> PUMP_RUNTIME_ACC >= 1800000000))",
      "kind": "data",
      "verified_by": "bounded_checker"
    },
    {
      "sid": "S4",
      "text": "当 VFD_RUN 为 FALSE 时，累计运行时间必须与上一拍相同（停机保持，不清零也不增加）。",
      "ltl": "G(NOT VFD_RUN -> PUMP_RUNTIME_ACC = prev(PUMP_RUNTIME_ACC))",
      "kind": "sequencing",
      "verified_by": "bounded_checker"
    },
    {
      "sid": "S5",
      "text": "运行每拍的累计增加量等于该拍实际毫秒数。",
      "ltl": "G(VFD_RUN -> PUMP_RUNTIME_ACC = prev(PUMP_RUNTIME_ACC) + CycleMs)",
      "kind": "data",
      "verified_by": "bounded_checker"
    },
    {
      "sid": "S6",
      "text": "连续有效段的第一拍仅在本次调用时间达到当前阈值时启动。",
      "ltl": "G(((PASTE_E_STOP_NC AND VISCOSITY_OK) AND NOT prev((PASTE_E_STOP_NC AND VISCOSITY_OK))) -> (VFD_RUN <-> CycleMs >= DebounceMs))",
      "kind": "safety",
      "verified_by": "bounded_checker"
    },
    {
      "sid": "S7",
      "text": "连续有效段的第二拍以两次真实间隔之和与当前阈值比较。",
      "ltl": "G(((PASTE_E_STOP_NC AND VISCOSITY_OK) AND prev((PASTE_E_STOP_NC AND VISCOSITY_OK)) AND NOT prev(prev((PASTE_E_STOP_NC AND VISCOSITY_OK)))) -> (VFD_RUN <-> CycleMs + prev(CycleMs) >= DebounceMs))",
      "kind": "safety",
      "verified_by": "bounded_checker"
    },
    {
      "sid": "S8",
      "text": "单拍间隔已达阈值，或仍连续合格且上拍已运行、本拍阈值不增时，泵必须运行。",
      "ltl": "G(((PASTE_E_STOP_NC AND VISCOSITY_OK) AND (CycleMs >= DebounceMs OR (prev(VFD_RUN) AND DebounceMs <= prev(DebounceMs)))) -> VFD_RUN)",
      "kind": "safety",
      "verified_by": "bounded_checker"
    }
  ],
