  "language": "en",
  "raw_text": "# Jam Pump Debouncing and Runtime Maintenance\n\n- **Difficulty:** Easy (easy)\n\n## Requirements\n\nControl a jam transfer pump on a food production line, including viscosity-signal debouncing, emergency-stop priority, runtime accumulation and a maintenance-due indication.\n\n1. Accept the viscosity condition only after VISCOSITY_OK has remained TRUE for DebounceTime. Invalidate the condition immediately when the input becomes FALSE.\n2. Allow VFD_RUN to be TRUE only when PASTE_E_STOP_NC is TRUE and the viscosity condition is valid. An emergency stop immediately disables the run output and clears any incomplete debounce timing.\n3. Accumulate PUMP_RUNTIME_ACC using the actual invocation interval CycleTime only while VFD_RUN is TRUE. Preserve the accumulated time while the pump is stopped.\n4. Set PUMP_MAINT_DUE when accumulated runtime reaches 500 hours. This indication is informational and must not affect pump operation or the safety permissive.\n5. At power-up, initialize the run output to OFF, accumulated runtime to zero and the maintenance indication to FALSE.\n\n## Interface Definition\n\n| Direction | Variable/Field | Data Type | Description |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| Input | `VISCOSITY_OK` | `BOOL` | Raw signal indicating that viscosity is within the permitted range. |\n| Input | `PASTE_E_STOP_NC` | `BOOL` | Normally closed emergency-stop circuit; TRUE permits operation and FALSE means emergency stop. |\n| Input | `DebounceTime` | `TIME` | Required continuous valid duration for the viscosity signal; must be positive. |\n| Input | `CycleTime` | `TIME` | Actual elapsed interval represented by this invocation; must be positive. |\n| Output | `VFD_RUN` | `BOOL` | Pump variable-frequency-drive run command. |\n| Output | `PUMP_MAINT_DUE` | `BOOL` | Maintenance indication when accumulated runtime reaches 500 hours. |\n| Output | `PUMP_RUNTIME_ACC` | `LTIME` | Accumulated enabled runtime, using a long-duration time type. |",
  "case_mode": "sequence",
  "mc_inputs": {
    "DebounceMs": [
      30,
      90
    ],
    "CycleMs": [
      10,
      30,
      40
    ],
    "PASTE_E_STOP_NC": [
      false,
      true
    ],
    "VISCOSITY_OK": [
      false,
      true
    ]
  },
  "mc_max_depth": 8,
  "mc_max_traces": 60000
}
